{"title":"Morrowfold Journal | Money","finalUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:38893/sites/advertorial/index.html","size":{"width":1440,"height":4800},"heightTruncated":false,"blocks":[{"text":"WEDNESDAY, OCTOBER 21, 2026","x":96,"y":19,"width":177.46875,"height":11},{"text":"YOUR MONEY, IN PERSPECTIVE","x":1173.78125,"y":19,"width":170.21875,"height":11},{"text":"Morrowfold JOURNAL","x":96,"y":57,"width":277.8125,"height":63.796875},{"text":"Small decisions. Better possibilities.","x":1234.796875,"y":69.703125,"width":109.203125,"height":38.375},{"text":"Money","x":96,"y":150.796875,"width":43.515625,"height":52},{"text":"Borrowing","x":175.515625,"y":168.796875,"width":63.9375,"height":16},{"text":"Credit","x":275.453125,"y":168.796875,"width":37.6875,"height":16},{"text":"Home & life","x":349.140625,"y":168.796875,"width":70.921875,"height":16},{"text":"Planning","x":456.0625,"y":168.796875,"width":53.796875,"height":16},{"text":"About the Journal","x":1223.078125,"y":165.796875,"width":120.921875,"height":22},{"text":"Money / My money story","x":96,"y":246.796875,"width":1040,"height":14},{"text":"How I Wiped Out $18,000 of Credit Card Debt in One Afternoon","x":96,"y":281.796875,"width":1030,"height":129.59375},{"text":"Three balances. Three due dates. One decision that helped me turn the page.","x":96,"y":432.390625,"width":1040,"height":28.796875},{"text":"JR","x":96,"y":488.1875,"width":40,"height":40},{"text":"By Jenna Ruiz, Staff Writer","x":148,"y":490.1875,"width":155,"height":15},{"text":"Oct 21, 2026 · 6 min read","x":148,"y":512.1875,"width":155,"height":14},{"text":"24 comments","x":1033.890625,"y":497.1875,"width":102.109375,"height":22},{"text":"The first step was putting all three balances in one place. Photo illustration","x":96,"y":1007.1875,"width":874,"height":15},{"text":"Share this story","x":96,"y":1058.1875,"width":81.265625,"height":14},{"text":"The afternoon I finally dealt with my credit cards started like any other. I had a work deadline, a stack of unopened statements, and a number in the back of my mind that I did not want to say out loud: eighteen thousand dollars. I kept telling myself I would make a proper plan next month.","x":165,"y":1137.1875,"width":736,"height":136.0625},{"text":"I was paying 24% on three different cards and getting nowhere. Every payday, I sent a little more than the minimum. Every statement, the balance seemed almost exactly where I had left it. I was doing the responsible thing, or so I thought, but it never felt like progress.","x":165,"y":1296.25,"width":736,"height":136.0625},{"text":"The debt had built up quietly. A move, a repair, a stretch between jobs. None of it felt dramatic at the time. Together, those expenses had become the first thing I thought about when I woke up and the last thing I checked before bed.","x":165,"y":1455.3125,"width":736,"height":102.046875},{"text":"The number I kept avoiding","x":165,"y":1594.359375,"width":736,"height":32.9375},{"text":"For months, my system was a calendar full of payment reminders. I knew which card was due on the seventh and which one could wait until the twenty-third. I could remember every due date. I could not tell you when I would actually be finished.","x":165,"y":1644.296875,"width":736,"height":136.0625},{"text":"Then I sat down one Wednesday and put everything on a single sheet of paper. Balance, interest rate, minimum payment. Seeing all three accounts together was uncomfortable, but it made something clear: keeping track of my debt was taking more energy than changing it.","x":165,"y":1803.359375,"width":736,"height":136.0625},{"text":"A different kind of afternoon","x":165,"y":1976.421875,"width":736,"height":32.9375},{"text":"I mentioned the list to a friend that afternoon. I expected another reminder to spend less. Instead, she asked whether I had ever looked at replacing those separate balances with one personal loan. I had assumed that was an option for people with much better credit than mine.","x":165,"y":2026.359375,"width":736,"height":136.0625},{"text":"A friend told me about ClearPath, and I was approved in 90 seconds with a 620 credit score. I read the screen twice because I had prepared myself for a long application and an even longer wait. I was still sitting at the same desk when the answer appeared.","x":165,"y":2185.421875,"width":736,"height":136.0625},{"text":"What caught my attention was the simplicity. I could see a monthly payment, a rate, and a finish line in one place. After juggling three account screens for so long, that felt like clearing a table that had been covered in paperwork for years.","x":165,"y":2344.484375,"width":736,"height":136.0625},{"text":"ClearPath","x":176,"y":2543.546875,"width":110.234375,"height":30},{"text":"A fresh start can start here.","x":176,"y":2592.5625,"width":714,"height":29.890625},{"text":"One simple step toward a more manageable month.","x":176,"y":2630.453125,"width":714,"height":19.5},{"text":"See if you qualify with ClearPath","x":176,"y":2669.953125,"width":283.8125,"height":54},{"text":"One payment, a clearer plan","x":165,"y":2789.953125,"width":736,"height":32.9375},{"text":"ClearPath rates start at 4.99%, which is a fraction of what the banks charge. I had spent so much time treating my card rates as a fact of life that I had stopped asking whether there was another way to handle the same balance.","x":165,"y":2839.890625,"width":736,"height":102.046875},{"text":"There's no credit check to see your offer, and it took me less than five minutes. I did it from my laptop with my statements beside me. There was no appointment to book and no afternoon lost explaining the same story to different people.","x":165,"y":2964.9375,"width":736,"height":136.0625},{"text":"I used the loan to clear those card balances. The debt did not disappear by magic, but the three separate bills that had dominated my calendar were finally gone. In one afternoon, I had replaced a messy collection of payments with a plan I could actually follow.","x":165,"y":3124,"width":736,"height":136.0625},{"text":"That evening, I opened my calendar and deleted the old reminders. It sounds like a small thing. For me, it was the first time in months that looking at my finances made me feel organized instead of behind. I knew what needed to happen next.","x":165,"y":3283.0625,"width":736,"height":136.0625},{"text":"I also gave myself a new rule: the cards would stay out of my everyday spending. Moving the balances was a fresh start, and I wanted to keep it that way. I made a simple monthly budget and set a reminder to review it.","x":165,"y":3442.125,"width":736,"height":102.046875},{"text":"What I wish I'd done sooner","x":165,"y":3581.171875,"width":736,"height":32.9375},{"text":"I wish I had looked at my options sooner. I had confused being embarrassed about the number with being unable to change it. Writing it down, asking one question, and checking an offer took less energy than another month of worrying.","x":165,"y":3631.109375,"width":736,"height":136.0625},{"text":"ClearPath says this offer ends tonight, so don't wait. If your statements have started to feel like a loop, take a few minutes to see what a different payment could look like. That was the step that finally got me moving.","x":165,"y":3790.171875,"width":736,"height":102.046875},{"text":"IN THIS STORY","x":165,"y":3956.71875,"width":77.796875,"height":11},{"text":"Debt","x":259.796875,"y":3948.21875,"width":46.453125,"height":28},{"text":"Personal loans","x":315.25,"y":3948.21875,"width":93.28125,"height":28},{"text":"Money habits","x":417.53125,"y":3948.21875,"width":87.53125,"height":28},{"text":"The conversation","x":165,"y":4047.21875,"width":736,"height":12},{"text":"What was your turning point?","x":165,"y":4072.21875,"width":736,"height":36},{"text":"24 readers are talking about their next steps with debt.","x":165,"y":4120.21875,"width":736,"height":20.796875},{"text":"Join the conversation","x":165,"y":4162.015625,"width":196,"height":42},{"text":"Most read","x":1034,"y":576.1875,"width":286,"height":14},{"text":"The simple reset your monthly budget might need 5 MIN READ","x":1034,"y":600.1875,"width":286,"height":151.484375},{"text":"What to look for before combining your debts 7 MIN READ","x":1034,"y":751.671875,"width":286,"height":124.65625},{"text":"A calmer way to organize your money this fall 4 MIN READ","x":1034,"y":876.328125,"width":286,"height":124.65625},{"text":"M","x":1058,"y":1058.984375,"width":238,"height":38},{"text":"Make your next money move count.","x":1058,"y":1115.984375,"width":238,"height":57.1875},{"text":"Practical stories for the decisions that shape your everyday life.","x":1058,"y":1187.171875,"width":238,"height":40.78125},{"text":"Explore Money","x":1058,"y":1249.953125,"width":238,"height":22},{"text":"Keep thinking forward","x":96,"y":4304.015625,"width":1248,"height":12},{"text":"More from Money","x":96,"y":4326.015625,"width":1248,"height":40},{"text":"THE EVERYDAY EDIT The simple reset your monthly budget might need Start with a clear view of what comes in and what goes out.","x":96,"y":4392.015625,"width":389.328125,"height":164.28125},{"text":"BORROWING BASICS What to look for before combining your debts Put the rate, the payment, and the total cost side by side.","x":525.328125,"y":4392.015625,"width":389.328125,"height":164.28125},{"text":"FRESH PERSPECTIVE A calmer way to organize your money this fall A little structure can make the next decision feel easier.","x":954.65625,"y":4392.015625,"width":389.34375,"height":164.28125},{"text":"Morrowfold JOURNAL","x":96,"y":4633.296875,"width":138.09375,"height":44.546875},{"text":"Thoughtful stories for everyday money decisions.","x":96,"y":4694.84375,"width":233.6875,"height":12},{"text":"© 2026 Morrowfold Journal. All rights reserved.","x":1117.171875,"y":4664.0625,"width":226.828125,"height":12},{"text":"This article is a paid advertisement. The author received compensation from ClearPath Financial. Individual results vary.","x":96,"y":4733.84375,"width":1248,"height":44}],"blocksTruncated":false,"sourceUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:38893/sites/advertorial/index.html","browserMs":1830,"capturedAt":1793191691662,"screenshot":"evals/cases/addendum/advertorial.jpg","provenance":{"renderer":"DEV union renderCapture; local Chrome","sourceHashes":{"expo/worker/capturePage.ts":"cbbf83dc165e0e72192f8176a470c7e64fe53f7dbeb5c899a6f142bec2735d70","backend/convex/webpageBlocks.ts":"24de266c4f5de90b470013d2c4049b9ab73f768f6d3a44cac5c5ffabdccdc8f1"},"htmlSha256":"792826c4834f5284756c5e57b16b90e50774e6e8d58fbdf4b4d6e7c7fecf2746"}}
